<title>GERMANY: Linde 1996 group net profit up slightly.</title>
<headline>Linde 1996 group net profit up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   396     vs 359</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    689     vs 620</p>
<p>    Group sales				  8,801   vs 1,231</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Plant construction		     1,294   vs 1,231</p>
<p>    --Mining construction		    3,920   vs 3,639</p>
<p>    --Refrigeration construction	   1,084   vs 949</p>
<p>    --Technical gas			    2,538   vs 2,470</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    8,936   vs 8,592</p>
<p>    Group investments			  1,109   vs 933</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    1,001   vs 891</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA)	44.10   vs 40 marks</p>
<p>    Group workforce (13.12.96)	     30,746  vs 30,068</p>
<p>Group pre-tax profit</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Plant construction		     46	vs 30</p>
<p>    --Mining technology			211     vs 223</p>
<p>    --Refrigeration technology	     27	vs 13</p>
<p>    --Technical gas			    404     vs 389</p>
<p>    Dividend recommendation		  17.50   vs 16 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - The full name of the group is Linde AG. The dividend recommendation will be taken up at the group's annual general meeting on May 13.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
